{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_50900","headline":"送建昌冯明府 · 王贞白","name":"送建昌冯明府","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"尝闻陶彭泽，解印归匡庐。\n今见冯海昏，辞官还隐居。\n贤人五百年，间生信非虚。\n清风激贪冒，白云同卷舒。\n家山列画屏，绿水环庭除。\n秋清对吟尊，羲皇人不如。\n只今建昌民，方话大冯君。\n何必遗爱碑，政声人尽闻。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"王贞白","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_50900.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_50900","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}